&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/OpAmp.Client-0.6.0-alpha.1/src/OpenTelemetry.OpAmp.Client/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
